#. Description of the plugin
#: consent-tracking-guard-for-wordpress.php
msgid ""
"Controls consent-aware tracking, service disclosures, embeds, and WP Consent "
"API sync."
msgstr ""
"Uz Klaro balstīts sīkdatņu piekrišanas baneris ar WP Consent API saderību."

#. Author of the plugin
#: consent-tracking-guard-for-wordpress.php
