#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:824
msgid ""
"Allows PixelYourSite advertising pixels, server events, and matching cookies."
msgstr ""
"Atļauj PixelYourSite reklāmas pikseļus, servera notikumus un atbilstības "
"sīkdatnes."

