msgid "Polylang"
msgstr "Polylang"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:957
msgid ""
"Stores the visitor’s last browsed language for Polylang and Polylang for "
"WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā apmeklētāja pēdējo pārlūkoto valodu Polylang un Polylang for "
"WooCommerce vajadzībām."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:966
msgid ""
"Remembers the selected language for multilingual content and translated "
"WooCommerce flows."
msgstr ""
"Atceras atlasīto valodu daudzvalodu saturam un tulkotām WooCommerce plūsmām."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:982 src/Frontend/Assets.php:993
msgid "WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:994
msgid ""
"Keeps the shopping cart, checkout, customer session, and store notices "
"working."
msgstr ""
"Nodrošina iepirkumu groza, norēķinu, klienta sesijas un veikala paziņojumu "
"darbību."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1028 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1033
#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1043 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1048
#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1173 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1255
#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1260 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1265
#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1270 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1275
#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1280 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1400
msgid "Session"
msgstr "Sesija"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1029
msgid "Helps WooCommerce detect cart changes."
msgstr "Palīdz WooCommerce noteikt groza izmaiņas."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1034
msgid "Helps WooCommerce keep cart data synchronized."
msgstr "Palīdz WooCommerce sinhronizēt groza datus."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1038
msgid "2 days"
msgstr "2 dienas"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1039
msgid "Stores a unique customer session identifier for cart and checkout data."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā unikālu klienta sesijas identifikatoru groza un norēķinu datiem."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1044
msgid "Stores products viewed by the visitor."
msgstr "Saglabā apmeklētāja skatītos produktus."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1049
msgid "Remembers dismissed WooCommerce store notices."
msgstr "Atceras noraidītos WooCommerce veikala paziņojumus."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1061
msgid "WooCommerce source attribution"
msgstr "WooCommerce avota attiecināšana"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1065
msgid ""
"Stores first-party source attribution data for WooCommerce order reporting."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā pirmās puses avota attiecināšanas datus WooCommerce pasūtījumu "
"pārskatiem."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1097 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1105
#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1113 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1121
#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1129 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1139
msgid "6 months"
msgstr "6 mēneši"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1098
msgid ""
"Stores the visitor’s current traffic source for WooCommerce order "
"attribution."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā apmeklētāja pašreizējo datplūsmas avotu WooCommerce pasūtījumu "
"attiecināšanai."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1106
msgid ""
"Stores additional current traffic source details for WooCommerce order "
"attribution."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā papildu pašreizējā datplūsmas avota informāciju WooCommerce "
"pasūtījumu attiecināšanai."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1114
msgid ""
"Stores the visitor’s first traffic source for WooCommerce order attribution."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā apmeklētāja pirmo datplūsmas avotu WooCommerce pasūtījumu "
"attiecināšanai."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1122
msgid ""
"Stores additional first traffic source details for WooCommerce order "
"attribution."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā papildu pirmā datplūsmas avota informāciju WooCommerce pasūtījumu "
"attiecināšanai."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1130
msgid "Tracks Sourcebuster cookie format migrations."
msgstr "Izseko Sourcebuster sīkdatņu formāta migrācijas."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1134
msgid "30 minutes"
msgstr "30 minūtes"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1135
msgid "Stores the visitor’s current source attribution session."
msgstr "Saglabā apmeklētāja pašreizējo avota attiecināšanas sesiju."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1140
msgid ""
"Stores visitor user-agent and page attribution details for WooCommerce order "
"reporting."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā apmeklētāja lietotāja aģenta un lapas attiecināšanas informāciju "
"WooCommerce pasūtījumu pārskatiem."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1155 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1182
msgid "Klaviyo"
msgstr "Klaviyo"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1166
msgid ""
"Stores Klaviyo visitor identity for email marketing, attribution, and "
"WooCommerce tracking."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā Klaviyo apmeklētāja identitāti e-pasta mārketingam, attiecināšanai "
"un WooCommerce izsekošanai."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1174
msgid "Disables Klaviyo tracking until marketing consent is granted."
msgstr "Atspējo Klaviyo izsekošanu, līdz tiek dota mārketinga piekrišana."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1183
msgid ""
"Supports Klaviyo email marketing attribution, forms, and WooCommerce "
"activity tracking."
msgstr ""
"Atbalsta Klaviyo e-pasta mārketinga attiecināšanu, veidlapas un WooCommerce "
"aktivitāšu izsekošanu."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1199 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1210
msgid "WoodMart"
msgstr "WoodMart"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1211
msgid ""
"Keeps WoodMart shop preferences, wishlist, compare, product history, and "
"popups working."
msgstr ""
"Nodrošina WoodMart veikala preferenču, vēlmju saraksta, salīdzināšanas, "
"produktu vēstures un uznirstošo logu darbību."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1251
msgid "Stores products recently viewed by the visitor."
msgstr "Saglabā apmeklētāja nesen skatītos produktus."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1256
msgid "Checks whether the visitor’s WoodMart wishlist has changed."
msgstr "Pārbauda, vai apmeklētāja WoodMart vēlmju saraksts ir mainījies."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1261
msgid "Stores the number of products in the visitor’s WoodMart wishlist."
msgstr "Saglabā produktu skaitu apmeklētāja WoodMart vēlmju sarakstā."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1266
msgid "Stores products added to the visitor’s WoodMart wishlist."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā produktus, kas pievienoti apmeklētāja WoodMart vēlmju sarakstam."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1271
msgid "Stores products added to the visitor’s WoodMart compare list."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā produktus, kas pievienoti apmeklētāja WoodMart salīdzināšanas "
"sarakstam."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1276
msgid "Remembers the visitor’s selected shop list or grid view."
msgstr "Atceras apmeklētāja atlasīto veikala saraksta vai režģa skatu."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1281
msgid "Remembers that the visitor passed the WoodMart age verification prompt."
msgstr "Atceras, ka apmeklētājs ir izgājis WoodMart vecuma pārbaudes uzvedni."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1293 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1304
msgid "Wordfence"
msgstr "Wordfence"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1305
msgid ""
"Supports the Wordfence firewall, country blocking bypasses, login alerts, "
"and plugin linking."
msgstr ""
"Atbalsta Wordfence ugunsmūri, valstu bloķēšanas apiešanu, pieteikšanās "
"brīdinājumus un spraudņa sasaistīšanu."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1336
msgid "12 hours"
msgstr "12 stundas"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1337
msgid ""
"Allows the Wordfence firewall to identify logged-in users and their roles."
msgstr ""
"Ļauj Wordfence ugunsmūrim identificēt pieteikušos lietotājus un viņu lomas."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1342
msgid "Stores a country blocking bypass granted by a hidden access URL."
msgstr ""
"Saglabā valsts bloķēšanas apiešanu, kas piešķirta ar slēptu piekļuves URL."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1347
msgid ""
"Remembers that a Wordfence new-device login alert has already been sent."
msgstr ""
"Atceras, ka Wordfence jaunas ierīces pieteikšanās brīdinājums jau ir "
"nosūtīts."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1352
msgid "Tracks a Wordfence plugin license or account linking action."
msgstr "Izseko Wordfence spraudņa licences vai konta sasaistīšanas darbību."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1357
msgid "Remembers that Wordfence has verified the visitor as human."
msgstr "Atceras, ka Wordfence ir pārbaudījis apmeklētāju kā cilvēku."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1369
msgid "YouTube"
msgstr "YouTube"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1373
msgid "Loads embedded videos provided by YouTube."
msgstr "Ielādē YouTube nodrošinātos iegultos video."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1388 src/Frontend/Assets.php:1394
msgid "180 days"
msgstr "180 dienas"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1389
msgid "Measures bandwidth and player interface selection."
msgstr "Mēra joslas platumu un atskaņotāja saskarnes izvēli."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1395
msgid "Stores the visitor’s YouTube privacy state."
msgstr "Saglabā apmeklētāja YouTube privātuma stāvokli."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1401
msgid "Maintains YouTube video-view session data."
msgstr "Uztur YouTube video skatīšanās sesijas datus."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1406
msgid "8 months"
msgstr "8 mēneši"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:1407
msgid "Stores YouTube playback and display preferences."
msgstr "Saglabā YouTube atskaņošanas un attēlošanas preferences."

